  "content": "<p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\"><br>区块加载缓慢，仿佛它在回忆你。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">你曾来过这里，留下了一些东西。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">现在它憎恶你。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\"><strong>Tape_37</strong> 是一款注重绝对沉浸感的恐怖整合包。其纹理模仿了多年前失传的复古、高对比度艺术风格，画面呈现出一种恢复感与噪点感，夜晚则可能变得极其黑暗。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">功能特色&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">轻量且沉浸 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">&ndash; 专为性能优化设计，同时不牺牲沉浸感</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">黑暗至关重要</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> &ndash; 夜晚漆黑一片。带上火把&mdash;&mdash;或者待在光亮处。</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">模拟恐怖氛围</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> &ndash; 微弱的 VHS 碎片和浓重的雾气，让每一步都令人不安。</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">奇异结构</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> &ndash; 神秘的结构出现在世界各地，仿佛有人在你之前来过。</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">由 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Ludocrypt 创作的自定义配乐</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">以增强沉浸感</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">以及更多</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\"><strong>目前仍处于早期发布阶段，未来很可能会发生变化。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\"><strong>头像由 Discord 用户 junhanpurin 提供</strong></span></p>",
